#: ../../resources_page.rst:278
msgid ""
"Simple Krita Plugin that lists the images you have on a folder you specify, "
"with the ability to filter by words in the path. After setting the "
"references directory in `Photobash Images` docker you can:"
msgstr ""
"Enkelt Krita-insticksprogram som listar bilderna man har i en katalog man "
"anger, med möjligheten att filtrera enligt ord i sökvägen. Efter att ha "
"ställt in referenskatalogen i panelen `Photobash Images`kan man:"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:280
