"insticksprogrammet filen :file:`spine.json`."

#: ../../resources_page.rst:326
msgid "https://github.com/chartinger/krita-unofficial-spine-export"
msgstr "https://github.com/chartinger/krita-unofficial-spine-export"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:328
msgid "Key Enter"
msgstr "Ange nyckelord"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:330
msgid ""
"This plugin helps to quickly organize images using a standard nomenclature "
"through the usage of Keywords. These keywords are used for file filtering "
"purposes. Key Enter has a custom version of Photobash Images."
msgstr ""
"Insticksprogrammet hjälper till att snabbt organisera bilder genom att "
"använda en standardiserad terminologi via användning av nyckelord. "
"Nyckelorden används i filfiltreringssyfte. Ange nyckelord har en egen "
"version av Photobash-bilder."

#: ../../resources_page.rst:332
msgid "https://github.com/EyeOdin/key_enter"
msgstr "https://github.com/EyeOdin/key_enter"

